/BLOCK TRANSFER ROUTINE

BLT0,	0
	TAD I BLT0	/SOURCE ADDRESS -1
	DCA 10
	ISZ BLT0
	TAD I BLT0	/DEST. ADD
	ISZ BLT0
	DCA 11
	TAD I BLT0
